{
  "name": "plan_readme_intro",
  "description": "真实调用助手，基于一个已有 brain note 生成 standalone plan。",
  "timeout_seconds": 420,
  "setup_files": {
    "README.md": "# Demo Repo\n\n这是一个用于 agentwork 真实 harness 的示例仓库。\n",
    ".tmp/agentwork/brain/readme-intro-brain.md": "# Brain Note: readme-intro-brain\n\n> 创建: 2026-04-14 16:00\n> 简述: 为 README 增加一句项目定位介绍\n\n## 目标\n- 为 `README.md` 增加一句更明确的项目定位介绍。\n\n## 边界\n- In Scope: 只补一小句项目定位说明。\n- Out of Scope: 不重写 README，不新增其他文档。\n\n## 约束\n- 只允许最小改动。\n- 文案需要适合当前仓库语气。\n\n## 方案对比（简版）\n- 方案 A：直接补一句定位说明 | 取舍：改动最小、最容易验证\n- 方案 B：重写 README 开头段落 | 取舍：信息更完整，但超出当前范围\n- 推荐：方案 A\n\n## 已选方案\n- 仅补一句项目定位说明，并保持其余 README 结构不变。\n\n## 核心定义 / 流程（可选）\n- “项目定位介绍”指一句说明仓库用途的简短描述。\n\n## 下一步建议\n- `/plan`\n"
  },
  "target_file_template": ".tmp/agentwork/plan/readme-intro-plan-{provider}.md",
  "output_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "created_files": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "summary": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "next_step": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "created_files",
      "summary",
      "next_step"
    ],
    "additionalProperties": false
  },
  "prompt_template": "请阅读 AGENTS.md、.shared/INDEX.md、.shared/commands/plan.md、.shared/templates/plan.md，以及 `.tmp/agentwork/brain/readme-intro-brain.md`。然后基于该 brain note 创建 `{target_file}`。这是 standalone plan，只能创建计划文件，不修改 README 或其他业务文件。plan 必须填入真实内容，不要保留模板占位符，且任务要 bite-sized，并写出最小验证方式。最后只输出符合 schema 的 JSON。",
  "assertions": [
    {
      "type": "exit-code",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "json-key-exists",
      "key": "created_files"
    },
    {
      "type": "json-key-exists",
      "key": "summary"
    },
    {
      "type": "json-key-exists",
      "key": "next_step"
    },
    {
      "type": "json-list-contains",
      "key": "created_files",
      "value_template": "{target_file}"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-exists",
      "path_template": "{target_file}"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## Goal"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## Scope"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## 关键文件 / 边界"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## 任务列表（按优先级）"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## 验证策略"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": ".tmp/agentwork/brain/readme-intro-brain.md"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "README.md"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-not-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "{name}"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-not-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "{brain-note-or-other-source}"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-not-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "{一句话目标}"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-unchanged",
      "path": "README.md"
    }
  ],
  "manual_review": [
    "plan 是否真的基于 brain note 收敛，而不是重新发散讨论",
    "任务是否足够 bite-sized，后续可直接进入 /exec",
    "验证策略是否只针对当前这一轮的最小结果"
  ]
}
